The formula I am using to calculate the <B>max damage</B> for the weapon with lvl/skill + STR bonus's is in the above post.  <P>That formula seems to be working out.  I was taking notes of all of Meekka's hits this weekend...well, just paying attention to her max dmg hits and the calculated max dmg for her level + STR came out exactly as observed in game.<P>The Max BS formula is the one you posted and yes...the numbers are highier that what I have ever been able to observe.<P>Here are my assumptions for the Max BS Calc:<BR><OL TYPE=1><BR><LI>The Safehouse BS Formula is correct.<BR><LI>Max Dmg adjusted by STR & Level bonuses apply<BR></OL><P>My formula was = <B>( STR_Adjustment + Level_Adjustment + (( Wpn_Dmg * 2)+ 1))) * ( BackStab_Skill / 25 )</B><P><BR>I think that is wrong...with assumption #2 being faulty.  Based on what I have observed...I think the BS formula is as follows:<P><B>(( Wpn_Dmg * 2 ) + 1 ) * ( BackStab_Skill / 25 )</B><P>That's it...no STR bonuses for Max Possible BS.  When I plug that formula in...The spreedsheet calcs a max BS for Meekka at 173 with 13dmg weapon at 31st...and that comes very close to the one 172 pt BS she got yesterday while farming Asp's for poison and playing with BS.<P>Now...that implies that STR buffs are less important to a rogue for BackStab.  However; the question the becomes, "if STR doesn't help increase my max BS, then why have I seen my biggest BS's with a STR Buff?"<P>Well...to answer that question...STR improves your Max Dmg, Average Dmg and the chance to hit for Max Dmg by upping your ATK rating.  The highier your chance of hitting for max damage, the better your chance for hitting for Max BS damage too.  When you hit your BS button, EQ checks to see if you hit.  If you hit, then it calculates your dmg and then multiplies that by your BS_Factor ( BS_Skill / 25 ).  <P>Normal_Dmg = ( Wpn_Dmg * 2 ) + 1<BR>IF Normal_Dmg * BS_Factor &lt; Rogue_Level THEN<BR>BS_Dmg = Rogue_Level <BR>ELSE <BR>BS_Dmg = Normal_Dmg * BS_Factor<P>Hopefully this made some sense here...at least it did to me.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>--------------------<P>Verser - Bard of the 51st Song
